    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get you. i'm just so stressed and the pain is making it hard to think. if i can't take advil, can i just take a couple of tylenol instead? i have some at home right now. is that totally fine to take for a headache during the first trimester? i just really need some relief so i can rest.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
